NOTE ON DEPENDENCIES

The MIT licence above covers the source code in this repository only.

Building it requires the Havok 2010.2 SDK, which is proprietary and is NOT
included here and NOT covered by this licence. You must obtain it yourself.

The skeleton meshes (meshes/.../PPB/*.nif) are XP32 Maximum Skeleton Special
Extended skeletons with PPB's Havok collision layer built onto them. XPMSSE's
author states that its skeleton .nif files are permission-free, being based on
Bethesda's original files, and explicitly permits modifying them and shipping
those modifications inside other mods. PPB is not, and must not be used as, an
XPMSSE replacement -- it REQUIRES XP32 to be installed.

Credit for the underlying skeleton belongs to Groovtama (XPMSSE) and xp32.
